  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_d20daec2e25a42e49db458940d074565",
      "statement": "ENS-1120 is a Planned initiative on the Enterprise Notification Service roadmap, targeted for 2027-H1 and owned by Melissa Grant, to add 'entity-level subscriptions' letting a user subscribe to a specific paymentId or caseId.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/ens-int-3.2-enterprise-notification-service-integration-guide.md#L49-L51",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7b6750fc41945eae6836d5115964229ec2e5835b12941bb5e45adddb0e807434:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/jira-export-wt-discovery-2026-10-05.md#L64-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:14b559e05d7d58640a033ebbc11bfdd14789883f6f7ed8a57e0874f23b5790a5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1e7358fd702e4ddc95ceee92ea18af2a",
      "statement": "ENS's current subscription model is scoped per user to an event type with only accountId and amount-threshold filters (created via POST /ens/v3/subscriptions, EP-ENS-02); it does not support subscribing to an individual entity such as a specific paymentId, which is why ENS-1120 is tracked as a separate future initiative rather than a configuration change.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/ens-int-3.2-enterprise-notification-service-integration-guide.md#L49-L51",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7b6750fc41945eae6836d5115964229ec2e5835b12941bb5e45adddb0e807434:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/ens-int-3.2-enterprise-notification-service-integration-guide.md#L77-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4f45975b846200812fde2391ef6afd25cb58b11f2bac4f9684677bbe291c229d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cded4839dbc14e93806a6f4557ed22b4",
      "statement": "The ENS Treasury (TRS) event catalog has no registered event type for client action required on held wires (nor for wire network acceptance, gpi beneficiary credit/ACCC, wire returns, or other gpi milestones), so even with entity-level subscriptions, there is currently no event to subscribe to for a held-wire client-action notification.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/ens-int-3.2-enterprise-notification-service-integration-guide.md#L75-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c711a202e3c02b999cc47706e6568e6e339edc12411a572c9c0f6bdb3ece5e3c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6e7d8121c2d248209d05fbf737bcecd4",
      "statement": "Held wires in CBO Wire Center show only a generic 'Pending Review' status with static text ('This wire is being reviewed.'); Wire Center has no hold-reason data and no client-action workflow, so there is no client-facing path today to tell a client that action is required on a specific held wire.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/cbo-arch-wc-4.1-wire-center-current-state-architecture.md#L24-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6eb4e1fbf4a28ebb51b329886e3dba84d73bfd15ce56217f8416810cbee7689e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/cbo-arch-wc-4.1-wire-center-current-state-architecture.md#L95-L95",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c9572b60da76a73ca7c96373d1e66f7c643333797a58bc5f4210425cf360d4e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_09b6d11828e241df979d727e25dd77a3",
      "statement": "Even if ENS-1120 ships, it would not create a channel-authorized path into hold detail: ADR-PAY-021 restricts hold reason codes, descriptions, scores, and analyst notes to FCT systems, risk.hold.events.v1 is restricted to FCT/Payment Operations tooling, and the only proposed client-safe facade (FCT-1893) is deprioritized backlog with no delivery date, so a compliant held-wire client-action notification would still need FCC-approved copy from a facade that does not exist, independent of subscription granularity.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/jira-export-wt-discovery-2026-10-05.md#L143-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8a6d63076fc11a9e4bd00e83736be541e05a667aa0ea1f20f1a9daa71884644:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/prsp-hms-3.4-hold-management-service-design-and-reason-taxonomy-restricted.md#L72-L88",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5109dbbc64fa96e0bb6361a1f1f3e0c64498e0e9fa0d00ab755ced02794214cd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0864fb7ebba1473ea2b1616a9fa03303",
      "statement": "Per ADR-PAY-019, any new wire status capability for Wire Center (such as a held-wire client-action notification) must be event-driven rather than polling-based, but Wire Center currently has no event-driven path for wires: it still calls PPH v1 synchronously, the Status Projection Service is configured for ACH only, and pay.wire.lifecycle.v2 is unused, so an entity-level, held-wire notification would additionally require a PPH v2 migration (CBO-4471) or a new SPS wire mapping module with a pay.wire.lifecycle.v2 consumer ACL.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/cbo-arch-wc-4.1-wire-center-current-state-architecture.md#L39-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0ed39e07f6b48af7291442569c962064b7e091e9ce3598a928ff7ec23c00a01a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/jira-export-wt-discovery-2026-10-05.md#L123-L129",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b98a4269ebd7df79bd67e4f14df8ca99146ecfcf518700069a8a6c3d8d399810:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d5f262d4db564e0192a277347345c452",
      "statement": "ENS-1120's 2027-H1 target overlaps the mandatory PPH v1 sunset date of 2027-03-31 (no extensions, per the 2026-09-08 ARB decision), which bears on the realistic sequencing of any Wire Center feature that would depend on both entity-level subscriptions and PPH v2/event-driven plumbing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/jira-export-wt-discovery-2026-10-05.md#L137-L141",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:04068018a39909221bd96b517609deb4cee9d42a30b8ab9ebbc7b70e7a2c47aa:"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
